{"title":"Murim Login","synopsis":"Sebuah era di mana para hunter hidup dengan berburu monster yang berasal dari Dungeon\nJin TaeKyung adalah hunter tingkat rendah yang mengambil mesin VR dan secara tidak sengaja masuk ke dalam game yang diatur dalam dunia Seni Bela Diri\nSetelah berkalikali jatuh bangun TaeKyung mampu melarikan diri dari dunia ini\nKekuatan dan keterampilan yang ia terima di Murim dapat dibawa kembali ke dunia nyata\nIni memungkinkannya untuk terus mencari nafkah sebagai hunter tetapi dia memutuskan untuk kembali ke dunia Murim karena tidak merawat temanteman NPCnya","alternative_title":"로그인무림","author":"Zerobic","artist":"Jang Cheol-Byuk","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"54e6905d-bb95-497e-976e-8d8de397b6db","number":"250","title":"Chapter 250","date":"2026-02-06","images":[]},{"id":"e96cc0d6-8f67-4738-9c89-96025bee0487","number":"249","title":"Chapter 249","date":"2026-02-02","images":[]},{"id":"d908a6a6-d46f-42ec-9a50-dae7c15cb1cf","number":"248","title":"Chapter 248","date":"2026-01-20","images":[]},{"id":"01838cb4-e36e-4ae2-ab6e-e0198e77d1ce","number":"247","title":"Chapter 247","date":"2026-01-10","images":[]},{"id":"eeeb3581-f2d3-4d97-af6e-133657444509","number":"246","title":"Chapter 246","date":"2026-01-03","images":[]},{"id":"85329612-8afb-4a81-824b-01a8239e407d","number":"245","title":"Chapter 245","date":"2025-12-22","images":[]},{"id":"810618b2-ac8f-4f81-95b3-327e2e3bebdc","number":"244","title":"Chapter 244","date":"2025-12-13","images":[]},{"id":"1d272688-32e1-473a-a3c2-d7912cd00e3d","number":"243","title":"Chapter 243","date":"2025-12-06","images":[]},{"id":"149891a1-d4d0-4f50-95f2-3dd0ab061eb6","number":"242","title":"Chapter 242","date":"2025-11-24","images":[]},{"id":"ab3fa121-51c1-4227-b4b3-fa55829ccf96","number":"241","title":"Chapter 241","date":"2025-11-14","images":[]},{"id":"9936c46c-45e2-4ffa-a250-acc964769f85","number":"240","title":"Chapter 240","date":"2025-11-04","images":[]